# "If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn": the replacement lasts only this turn (CR 611.2c, 514.2). Anger of
# the Gods's 3 damage does not kill the 0/4 Spellskite on turn 3 and wears off at cleanup. On turn 5 two Lightning Bolts kill
# it (3 + 3 against 4): the replacement is over, so it goes to the graveyard, not to exile.

